#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Code Assistant {#qiskit-code-assistant}"
msgstr "Qiskit Code Assistant {#qiskit-code-assistant}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit Code Assistant LLMs aim to make quantum computing more accessible to "
"new Qiskit adopters and to improve the coding experience for current users. "
"It is trained using millions of text tokens from Qiskit SDK, years of Qiskit"
" code examples, and IBM Quantum&reg; features. Qiskit Code Assistant can "
"help your quantum development workflow by offering LLM-generated suggestions"
" based on [IBM Granite and other open-source "
"models](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit), which incorporate the latest "
"features and functionalities from IBM&reg;.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gli LLM di Qiskit Code Assistant mirano a rendere il quantum computing più "
"accessibile ai nuovi utenti di Qiskit e a migliorare l'esperienza di "
"programmazione per gli utenti già attivi. Sono stati addestrati utilizzando "
"milioni di token di testo dal Qiskit SDK, anni di esempi di codice Qiskit e "
"le funzionalità di IBM Quantum&reg;. Qiskit Code Assistant può supportare il"
" tuo flusso di lavoro per lo sviluppo quantistico offrendo suggerimenti "
"generati da LLM basati sui [modelli IBM Granite e altri modelli open "
"source](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit), che incorporano le funzionalità e le"
" caratteristiche più recenti di IBM&reg;.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"- **Want to skip to the installation instructions? Go to the [Install Qiskit Code Assistant](#install) section.**\n"
"- If you have feedback or want to contact the developer team, use the [Qiskit Slack Workspace channel](https://qiskit.enterprise.slack.com/archives/C07LYA6PL83) or the related public GitHub repositories.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Note\">\n"
"- **Vuoi passare direttamente alle istruzioni di installazione? Vai alla sezione [Installa Qiskit Code Assistant](#install).**\n"
"- Per inviare feedback o contattare il team di sviluppo, usa il [canale Qiskit Slack Workspace](https://qiskit.enterprise.slack.com/archives/C07LYA6PL83) o i repository pubblici GitHub correlati.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Large Language Model (LLM) behind Qiskit Code Assistant {#the-large-"
"language-model-llm-behind-qiskit-code-assistant}"
msgstr ""
"Il Large Language Model (LLM) alla base di Qiskit Code Assistant {#the-"
"large-language-model-llm-behind-qiskit-code-assistant}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To provide code suggestions, Qiskit Code Assistant uses a Large Language "
"Model (LLM). In this case, Qiskit Code Assistant currently relies on the "
"model `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit`, built on the [Mistral-"
"Small-3.2-24B-Qiskit model](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/mistral-"
"small-3.2-24b-qiskit). The `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` model improves the"
" `Mistral-Small-3.2-24B-Instruct-2506` model's code generation capabilities "
"for Qiskit through extended pretraining and fine-tuning it on high-quality "
"Qiskit data, as well as Python commits and chat. For more information about "
"the Mistral AI models family, refer to [Mistral AI "
"documentation](https://docs.mistral.ai/getting-started/models). For more "
"details about the `.*-qiskit` models, see [Qiskit Code Assistant: Training "
"LLMs for generating Quantum Computing "
"Code](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.19495).\n"
msgstr ""
"Per fornire suggerimenti di codice, Qiskit Code Assistant utilizza un Large "
"Language Model (LLM). In questo caso, Qiskit Code Assistant si basa "
"attualmente sul modello `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit`, costruito sul "
"[modello Mistral-"
"Small-3.2-24B-Qiskit](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/mistral-"
"small-3.2-24b-qiskit). Il modello `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` migliora le"
" capacità di generazione del codice per Qiskit del modello `Mistral-"
"Small-3.2-24B-Instruct-2506` attraverso un pre-addestramento esteso e il "
"fine-tuning su dati Qiskit di alta qualità, nonché commit Python e chat. Per"
" ulteriori informazioni sulla famiglia di modelli Mistral AI, consulta la "
"[documentazione di Mistral AI](https://docs.mistral.ai/getting-"
"started/models). Per maggiori dettagli sui modelli `.*-qiskit`, vedi [Qiskit"
" Code Assistant: Training LLMs for generating Quantum Computing "
"Code](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.19495).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Our LLMs specialized for Qiskit are available also as open-source models. "
"Check all the models available at https://huggingface.co/Qiskit.\n"
msgstr ""
"I nostri LLM specializzati per Qiskit sono disponibili anche come modelli "
"open source. Consulta tutti i modelli disponibili su "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit HumanEval and Qiskit HumanEval Hard benchmarks {#the-qiskit-"
"humaneval-and-qiskit-humaneval-hard-benchmarks}"
msgstr ""
"I benchmark Qiskit HumanEval e Qiskit HumanEval Hard {#the-qiskit-humaneval-"
"and-qiskit-humaneval-hard-benchmarks}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To test the `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` and other models, we collaborated"
" with Qiskit Advocates and experts to create the execution-based benchmarks "
"called Qiskit HumanEval (QHE) and Qiskit HumanEval Hard (QHE Hard), and ran "
"them on the models. These benchmarks are similar to "
"[HumanEval](https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.03374), including multiple "
"challenging code problems to solve, all based on the official Qiskit "
"libraries.\n"
msgstr ""
"Per testare il modello `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` e altri modelli, "
"abbiamo collaborato con i Qiskit Advocates ed esperti del settore per creare"
" i benchmark basati sull'esecuzione chiamati Qiskit HumanEval (QHE) e Qiskit"
" HumanEval Hard (QHE Hard), ed eseguirli sui modelli. Questi benchmark sono "
"simili a [HumanEval](https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.03374) e includono "
"molteplici problemi di codice impegnativi da risolvere, tutti basati sulle "
"librerie ufficiali di Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The benchmarks are composed of approximately 150 tests, each one made from a"
" function definition, followed by a docstring that details the task the "
"model is required to solve. Each example also includes a reference canonical"
" solution, as well as unit tests, to evaluate the correctness of the "
"generated solutions. There are three levels of difficulty for tests: basic, "
"intermediate, and difficult. The Qiskit HumanEval Hard benchmark is a "
"variation of the Qiskit HumanEval one, but removes information related to "
"code imports, so the LLM needs to figure out the right method or class "
"imports. This change makes the dataset much more challenging for LLMs, "
"according to our tests and initial results.\n"
msgstr ""
"I benchmark sono composti da circa 150 test, ognuno dei quali è composto da "
"una definizione di funzione seguita da una docstring che dettaglia il "
"compito che il modello deve risolvere. Ogni esempio include anche una "
"soluzione canonica di riferimento e unit test per valutare la correttezza "
"delle soluzioni generate. Esistono tre livelli di difficoltà per i test: "
"base, intermedio e difficile. Il benchmark Qiskit HumanEval Hard è una "
"variante del Qiskit HumanEval, ma rimuove le informazioni relative agli "
"import del codice, quindi l'LLM deve determinare autonomamente i giusti "
"import di metodi o classi. Questa modifica rende il dataset molto più "
"impegnativo per gli LLM, secondo i nostri test e i risultati iniziali.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The datasets for Qiskit HumanEval and Qiskit HumanEval Hard are available at"
" these websites: [Qiskit "
"HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval) and "
"[Qiskit "
"HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval_hard). "
"You can contribute to the development of these benchmarks at the [GitHub "
"repository](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-human-eval).\n"
msgstr ""
"I dataset per Qiskit HumanEval e Qiskit HumanEval Hard sono disponibili sui "
"seguenti siti: [Qiskit "
"HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval) e "
"[Qiskit "
"HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval_hard). "
"Puoi contribuire allo sviluppo di questi benchmark nel [repository "
"GitHub](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-human-eval).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"install\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"install\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Qiskit Code Assistant {#install-qiskit-code-assistant}"
msgstr "Installa Qiskit Code Assistant {#install-qiskit-code-assistant}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Learn how to install, configure, and use any of Qiskit Code Assistant models"
" on your local machine.\n"
msgstr ""
"Scopri come installare, configurare e usare uno qualsiasi dei modelli di "
"Qiskit Code Assistant sulla tua macchina locale.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Download from the Hugging Face website\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Scarica dal sito di Hugging Face\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow these steps to download any Qiskit Code Assistant-related model from "
"the Hugging Face website:\n"
msgstr ""
"Segui questi passaggi per scaricare qualsiasi modello correlato a Qiskit "
"Code Assistant dal sito di Hugging Face:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Navigate to the desired Qiskit model page on Hugging Face.\n"
msgstr "Vai alla pagina del modello Qiskit desiderato su Hugging Face.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go to the **Files and Versions** tab and download the safetensors or GGUF "
"model files.\n"
msgstr ""
"Vai alla scheda **Files and Versions** e scarica i file del modello in "
"formato safetensors o GGUF.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</AccordionItem>\n"
msgstr "</AccordionItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<AccordionItem title=\"Download using the Hugging Face CLI\">\n"
msgstr "<AccordionItem title=\"Scarica usando la CLI di Hugging Face\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To download any of the available Qiskit Code Assistant models using the "
"Hugging Face CLI, follow these steps:\n"
msgstr ""
"Per scaricare uno qualsiasi dei modelli Qiskit Code Assistant disponibili "
"usando la CLI di Hugging Face, segui questi passaggi:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the [Hugging Face "
"CLI](https://huggingface.co/docs/huggingface_hub/main/en/guides/cli)\n"
msgstr ""
"Installa la [CLI di Hugging "
"Face](https://huggingface.co/docs/huggingface_hub/main/en/guides/cli)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Log in to your Hugging Face account\n"
msgstr "Accedi al tuo account Hugging Face\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli login\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli login\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Download the model you prefer from the previous list\n"
msgstr "Scarica il modello che preferisci dall'elenco precedente\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli download <HF REPO NAME> <MODEL PATH> --local-dir <LOCAL PATH>\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli download <HF REPO NAME> <MODEL PATH> --local-dir <LOCAL PATH>\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Manually deploy the Qiskit Code Assistant models in "
"local through Ollama\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Distribuisci manualmente i modelli Qiskit Code "
"Assistant in locale tramite Ollama\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There are multiple ways to deploy and interact with the downloaded Qiskit "
"Code Assistant model. This guide demonstrates using "
"[Ollama](https://ollama.com) as follows: either with the [Ollama "
"application](#using-the-ollama-application) by using the Hugging Face Hub "
"integration or local model, or with the [`llama-cpp-python` package](#use-"
"llama-cpp-python).\n"
msgstr ""
"Esistono diversi modi per distribuire e interagire con il modello Qiskit "
"Code Assistant scaricato. Questa guida illustra l'uso di "
"[Ollama](https://ollama.com): tramite l'[applicazione Ollama](#using-the-"
"ollama-application) usando l'integrazione con Hugging Face Hub o il modello "
"locale, oppure con il [pacchetto `llama-cpp-python`](#use-llama-cpp-"
"python).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Using the Ollama application {#using-the-ollama-application}"
msgstr "Usare l'applicazione Ollama {#using-the-ollama-application}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Ollama application provides a simple solution to run the LLMs locally. "
"It is easy to use, with a CLI that makes the whole setup process, model "
"management, and interaction fairly straightforward. It’s ideal for quick "
"experimentation and for users that want fewer technical details to handle.\n"
msgstr ""
"L'applicazione Ollama offre una soluzione semplice per eseguire gli LLM in "
"locale. È facile da usare, con una CLI che rende l'intero processo di "
"configurazione, la gestione dei modelli e l'interazione piuttosto semplici. "
"È ideale per sperimentazioni rapide e per gli utenti che vogliono gestire "
"meno dettagli tecnici.\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Ollama {#install-ollama}"
msgstr "Installa Ollama {#install-ollama}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Download the [Ollama application](https://ollama.com/download)\n"
msgstr "Scarica l'[applicazione Ollama](https://ollama.com/download)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install the downloaded file\n"
msgstr "Installa il file scaricato\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Launch the installed Ollama application\n"
msgstr "Avvia l'applicazione Ollama installata\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"info\">\n"
"        The application is running successfully when the Ollama icon appears in the desktop menu bar. You can also verify the service is running by going to `http://localhost:11434/`.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"info\">\n"
"        L'applicazione è in esecuzione correttamente quando l'icona di Ollama appare nella barra dei menu del desktop. Puoi anche verificare che il servizio sia in esecuzione andando su `http://localhost:11434/`.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Try Ollama in your terminal and start running models. For example:\n"
msgstr ""
"Prova Ollama nel terminale e inizia a eseguire i modelli. Per esempio:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama run hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama run hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up Ollama using the Hugging Face Hub integration {#set-up-ollama-using-"
"the-hugging-face-hub-integration}"
msgstr ""
"Configura Ollama usando l'integrazione con Hugging Face Hub {#set-up-ollama-"
"using-the-hugging-face-hub-integration}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [Ollama/Hugging Face Hub "
"integration](https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/ollama) provides a way to "
"interact with models hosted on the Hugging Face Hub without needing to "
"create a new modelfile nor manually downloading the GGUF or safetensors "
"files. The default `template` and `params` files are already included for "
"the model on the Hugging Face Hub.\n"
msgstr ""
"L'[integrazione Ollama/Hugging Face "
"Hub](https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/ollama) offre un modo per interagire "
"con i modelli ospitati su Hugging Face Hub senza dover creare un nuovo "
"modelfile né scaricare manualmente i file GGUF o safetensors. I file "
"`template` e `params` predefiniti sono già inclusi per il modello su Hugging"
" Face Hub.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure the Ollama application is running.\n"
msgstr "Assicurati che l'applicazione Ollama sia in esecuzione.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go the desired model page, and copy the URL. For example, "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF.\n"
msgstr ""
"Vai alla pagina del modello desiderato e copia l'URL. Per esempio, "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "From your terminal, run the command:\n"
msgstr "Dal terminale, esegui il comando:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use the `hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` model or any of the "
"other currently recommended GGUF official models `hf.co/Qiskit/mistral-"
"small-3.2-24b-qiskit-GGUF` or `hf.co/Qiskit/granite-3.3-8b-qiskit-GGUF`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Puoi usare il modello `hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` o uno degli "
"altri modelli GGUF ufficiali attualmente consigliati `hf.co/Qiskit/mistral-"
"small-3.2-24b-qiskit-GGUF` o `hf.co/Qiskit/granite-3.3-8b-qiskit-GGUF`.\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up Ollama with a manually downloaded Qiskit Code Assistant GGUF model "
"{#set-up-ollama-with-a-manually-downloaded-qiskit-code-assistant-gguf-model}"
msgstr ""
"Configura Ollama con un modello GGUF di Qiskit Code Assistant scaricato "
"manualmente {#set-up-ollama-with-a-manually-downloaded-qiskit-code-"
"assistant-gguf-model}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have manually downloaded a GGUF model such as "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF and you want to "
"experiment with different templates and parameters, you can follow these "
"steps to load it into your local Ollama application.\n"
msgstr ""
"Se hai scaricato manualmente un modello GGUF come "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF e vuoi "
"sperimentare con template e parametri diversi, puoi seguire questi passaggi "
"per caricarlo nell'applicazione Ollama locale.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create a `Modelfile` entering the following content and be sure to update "
"`<PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>` to the actual path of your downloaded model.\n"
msgstr ""
"Crea un `Modelfile` inserendo il seguente contenuto e assicurati di "
"aggiornare `<PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>` con il percorso effettivo del modello "
"scaricato.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    FROM <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"
"    TEMPLATE \"\"\"{{ if .System }}\n"
"    System:\n"
"    {{ .System }}\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    FROM <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"
"    TEMPLATE \"\"\"{{ if .System }}\n"
"    System:\n"
"    {{ .System }}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    {{ end }}{{ if .Prompt }}Question:\n"
"    {{ .Prompt }}\n"
msgstr ""
"    {{ end }}{{ if .Prompt }}Question:\n"
"    {{ .Prompt }}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    {{ end }}Answer:\n"
"    ```\n"
"    \"\"\"\n"
msgstr ""
"    {{ end }}Answer:\n"
"    ```\n"
"    \"\"\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    PARAMETER stop \"Question:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"Answer:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"System:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"```\"\n"
msgstr ""
"    PARAMETER stop \"Question:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"Answer:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"System:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"```\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    PARAMETER temperature 0\n"
"    PARAMETER top_k 1\n"
msgstr ""
"    PARAMETER temperature 0\n"
"    PARAMETER top_k 1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "    ```\n"
msgstr "    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run the following command to create a custom model instance based on the "
"`Modelfile`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Esegui il seguente comando per creare un'istanza del modello personalizzata "
"basata sul `Modelfile`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama create Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit -f ./path-to-model-file\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama create Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit -f ./path-to-model-file\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"        This process may take some time for Ollama to read the model file, initialize the model instance, and configure it according to the specifications provided.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"        Questo processo potrebbe richiedere del tempo affinché Ollama legga il file del modello, inizializzi l'istanza del modello e la configuri in base alle specifiche fornite.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run the Qiskit Code Assistant model manually downloaded in Ollama"
msgstr ""
"Esegui il modello Qiskit Code Assistant scaricato manualmente in Ollama"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After the `Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` model has been set up in Ollama, run "
"the following command to launch the model and interact with it in the "
"terminal (in chat mode).\n"
msgstr ""
"Dopo che il modello `Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` è stato configurato in "
"Ollama, esegui il seguente comando per avviare il modello e interagire con "
"esso nel terminale (in modalità chat).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "from llama_cpp import Llama\n"
msgstr "from llama_cpp import Llama\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "model_path = <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"
msgstr "model_path = <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"model = Llama(\n"
"        model_path,\n"
"        seed=17,\n"
"        n_ctx=10000,\n"
"        n_gpu_layers=37, # to offload in gpu, but put 0 if all in cpu\n"
"    )\n"
msgstr ""
"model = Llama(\n"
"        model_path,\n"
"        seed=17,\n"
"        n_ctx=10000,\n"
"        n_gpu_layers=37, # to offload in gpu, but put 0 if all in cpu\n"
"    )\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"input = 'Generate a quantum circuit with 2 qubits'\n"
"raw_pred = model(input)[\"choices\"][0][\"text\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"input = 'Generate a quantum circuit with 2 qubits'\n"
"raw_pred = model(input)[\"choices\"][0][\"text\"]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"generation_kwargs = {\n"
"        \"max_tokens\": 512,\n"
"        \"echo\": False, # Echo the prompt in the output\n"
"        \"top_k\": 1\n"
"    }\n"
msgstr ""
"generation_kwargs = {\n"
"        \"max_tokens\": 512,\n"
"        \"echo\": False, # Echo the prompt in the output\n"
"        \"top_k\": 1\n"
"    }\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "raw_pred = model(input, **generation_kwargs)[\"choices\"][0][\"text\"]\n"
msgstr "raw_pred = model(input, **generation_kwargs)[\"choices\"][0][\"text\"]\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use a local model file {#use-a-local-model-file}"
msgstr "Use a local model file {#use-a-local-model-file}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "llama-cli -m my_model.gguf -cnv\n"
msgstr "llama-cli -m my_model.gguf -cnv\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Or download and run a model directly from Hugging Face {#or-download-and-"
"run-a-model-directly-from-hugging-face}"
msgstr ""
"Or download and run a model directly from Hugging Face {#or-download-and-"
"run-a-model-directly-from-hugging-face}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF -cnv\n"
msgstr "llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF -cnv\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "llama-server -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF\n"
msgstr "llama-server -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF \\\n"
"  -p \"You are a friendly assistant.\" -cnv \\\n"
"  --temp 0.7 \\\n"
"  --top-k 50 \\\n"
"  --top-p 0.95 \\\n"
"  --repeat-penalty 1.1 \\\n"
"  --seed 42\n"
msgstr ""
"llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF \\\n"
"  -p \"You are a friendly assistant.\" -cnv \\\n"
"  --temp 0.7 \\\n"
"  --top-k 50 \\\n"
"  --top-p 0.95 \\\n"
"  --repeat-penalty 1.1 \\\n"
"  --seed 42\n"

